
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f9e5ec">
<title>The Mathematics of My Feelings ♡</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 30px 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8fa,#f9e7ed 55%,#fff9f7);
  color: #654453;
  font-family: Georgia,serif;
}

main {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
}

.intro {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 10px;
}

.small {
  font: 11px Arial,sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #b4778e;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(32px,8vw,48px);
  font-weight: normal;
  font-style: italic;
  color: #a34f70;
  margin: 18px 0;
}

.intro p {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.image-card {
  margin: 25px 0;
  padding: 14px;
  background: #fffaf8;
  border: 1px solid #f0d4df;
  border-radius: 18px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px #b66c8620;
  animation: fade .8s ease;
}

.photo {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  max-height: none;
  object-fit: contain;
  object-position: center;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #fff;
}

.caption {
  text-align: center;
  font: 12px Arial,sans-serif;
  color: #a47787;
  margin: 13px 0 3px;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
}

.buttons {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin: 35px 0 20px;
}

button {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 13px 24px;
  background: #a34f70;
  color: white;
  font: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.back {
  background: #d9a0b4;
}

@keyframes fade {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px 10px;
  color: #b4778e;
  font-size: 13px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main>

  <header class="intro">
    <div class="small">A personal assessment</div>

    <h1>The Mathematics of My Feelings</h1>

    <p>
      Some calculations, a few honest answers,
      and one feeling behind it all.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="image-card">
    <img
      class="photo"
      src="images/01-data-method.jpg"
      alt="Data Method and Five-Point Rating Scale"
    >
    <div class="caption">
      01 · Data Method and Rating Scale
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="image-card">
    <img
      class="photo"
      src="images/02-questionnaire.jpg"
      alt="Seven-Question Personal Questionnaire"
    >
    <div class="caption">
      02 · My Questionnaire
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="image-card">
    <img
      class="photo"
      src="images/03-results-and-synthesis.jpg"
      alt="Frequency, Percentage Distribution, and Synthesis"
    >
    <div class="caption">
      03 · Results and Synthesis
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="buttons">
    <button class="back"
      onclick="location.href='page3.html'">
      ← Back
    </button>

    <button
      onclick="location.href='page5.html'">
      Continue ♡ →
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    A little website, made just for you · ♡
  </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
